        <div class="hero-product__main">
            {{> c-rating value="4.8" }}
            <p>DESIGNED FOR SKIN THAT USES LED</p>
            <h1>Blue+ Face Serum</h1>
            <article>
                <ul class="collapsed-list">
                    <li>
                        <span>Enhances how skin responds to LED light</span>
                        <p>Enhances how skin responds to LED light USP Methylene Blue is a cosmetic photosensitizer that helps convert LED light into a stronger skin response — so every Q-Rejuvalight Pro session works harder, without increasing intensity or heat.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>Helps target the appearance of congestion &amp; blemishes</span>
                        <p>Helps target the appearance of congestion &amp; blemishes Paired with Blue Light (Skin-Clearing Mode), it supports skin-clearing activity for a clearer-looking complexion — without harsh or drying actives.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>Hydrates and soothes while it protects</span>
                        <p>Hydrates and soothes while it protects Sodium Hyaluronate and Aloe Vera support hydration, while Methylene Blue and Vitamin E work as antioxidants — helping protect skin from the visible effects of everyday environmental stressors.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>Soothes skin from daily digital blue light exposure</span>
                        <p>Soothes skin from daily digital blue light exposure Calendula iActive helps comfort skin exposed to screens all day — phones, laptops, and everyday digital blue light — with no LED mask required.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>Lightweight, fast-absorbing, fits any routine</span>
                        <p>Lightweight, fast-absorbing, fits any routine An ultra-lightweight, fast-absorbing texture that layers easily under makeup or the rest of your routine, with or without an LED session.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <a
