                                        <strong class=\"c-benefit-grid__title\">Radiant Glow</strong>
                                        <p class=\"c-benefit-grid__text\">Less fatigued, more vibrant</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class=\"c-benefit-grid__item\">
                                    <span class=\"c-benefit-grid__icon\"><i class=\"e-icon e-icon-shield\"></i></span>
                                    <div class=\"c-benefit-grid__content\">
                                        <strong class=\"c-benefit-grid__title\">Long-Term Resilience</strong>
                                        <p class=\"c-benefit-grid__text\">Calmer, stronger skin</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>Blue+ Face Serum is designed for skin used with LED light therapy, with ingredients chosen to support skin exposed to light so your routine stays comfortable and consistent. It\'s lightweight, absorbs quickly, and sits comfortably on skin during LED use.</p>
                            <p>Visible benefits include:</p>
