                        "summary": "Why We Love It",
                        "text": "
                            <p>We designed Blue+ to solve a simple problem: most people use their LED mask the same way every time and hope for better results. But LED effectiveness depends on how your skin receives light, not just the device itself.</p>
                            <p>Blue+ prepares your skin so each session works harder, not harsher. It\'s the step that makes an LED routine feel complete – smarter results without adding time, intensity, or irritation.</p>
                            <p>For anyone who\'s already invested in LED, this is the upgrade that actually makes sense.</p>
                        "
                    },
